		r.Push("||POINT THE LIT FLASHLIGHT - BEAM LOOK: DARKDOOMZ|||||DO:~POINT THE LIT FLASHLIGHT~GET:~THE LIGHT TAKES THAT DARKDOOMZ TYPE'S COLOUR, ANGLES AND REACH; BEAM SIZE AND BEAM COLOUR NO LONGER APPLY. WITH THE SPILL LIGHT ON, A SECOND WIDER LIGHT IS ADDED~NEEDS:~BEAM LOOK: DARKDOOMZ (DEFAULT FNF); DARKDOOMZ BEAM TYPE (DEFAULT HALOGEN); DARKDOOMZ SPILL LIGHT (DEFAULT ON)");
